      "factId": "motorcycle-draft-001",
      "topicId": "motorcycle",
      "factText": "踏板摩托车常把发动机与传动装置合成可摆动单元；若发动机侧支架独立可拆，同一发动机更容易适配不同车架型号。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-motorcycle-unit-swing-engine"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "motorcycle-draft-002",
      "topicId": "motorcycle",
      "factText": "一种摩托车架让左右前主梁从车头管延伸到发动机固定点，再接续后主梁；发动机因此也参与连接车架前后结构。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-motorcycle-frame-engine-structure"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "motorcycle-draft-003",
      "topicId": "motorcycle",
      "factText": "摩托车前后悬架让车轮相对车身上下移动，弹簧承担载荷，阻尼器控制振动，两者通常合称减震器。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-motorcycle-wheel-suspension"],
